// arguments pushed before it. A raise is written `<method> threw <the error>`,
// as the node driver writes it; any other failure is written too, so the case
// cannot match its `.stdout`. Whether it answered.
private bool called(Engine g, Handle o, cstring method, string8 shown):
    try call_method(g, o, method) else code:
